# Presented-frame gate (frame generation, phase 0): boot to the city, settle, then 40 s of gentle
# driving (the "steady" segment) where presents are compared with guest swaps.
wait 8s
mark title
press_until start left_title every=2s timeout=90s
mark map_zoom
wait_until roam 180s
mark settle
wait 5s
mark steady
trigger rt 0.5
stick lx 0.15
wait 40s
release all
mark steady_end
wait 1s
